# 4. Your First Jenkins Job

Go to:

```text
Jenkins Dashboard
→ New Item
→ Enter name
→ Freestyle project
→ OK
```

Go to:

```text
Build Steps
→ Add build step
→ Execute shell
```

Enter:

```bash
echo "Hello Jenkins!"
```

Save and click:

```text
Build Now
```

Open:

```text
Build #1
→ Console Output
```

You should see:

```text
Hello Jenkins!
Finished: SUCCESS
```

